[{"client_msg_id":"56c233c7-03b3-48c1-8abe-68bb042379eb","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"店で生のherringはごくまれに入手できる。年に数日とかのレベル","ts":"1637826868.351900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jDzor"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31c7a2b6-dd65-4d5c-a873-81504ecedd32","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですです。ただこっちで出回ってるのはイメージ的にはイワシ的なサイズ","ts":"1637826852.351500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Iwm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DCD64A92-D6F8-4B36-A157-5FF31D46E35E","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"herring はニシンか","ts":"1637825421.351000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P3Uf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8edb077f-e0e0-4d0a-bb87-9edcbb31be6e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"これ知らなかった。日本の年越しそば的な感じかあ","ts":"1637825120.350500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v+wGC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15a1437b-d21e-4e65-b6b1-17b98ffcf676","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u0026gt; Pickled herring is also eaten at the stroke of midnight on New Year's Eve to symbolize a prosperous New Year in Poland, the Czech Republic, Germany, and parts of Scandinavia.[1]","ts":"1637825112.350200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x8ojK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3437bb0d-8035-4ffa-add9-14416328c17c","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"読んでる \u003chttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pickled_herring\u003e","ts":"1637825039.349900","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: Pickled herring","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/","title":"Pickled herring","title_link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pickled_herring","text":"Pickled herring is a traditional way of preserving herring as food by pickling or curing.\nMost cured herring uses a two-step curing process: it is first cured with salt to extract water; then the salt is removed and the herring is brined in vinegar, salt, and sugar solution, often with peppercorn, bay leaves, raw onions, and so on. Additional flavourings include sherry, mustard and dill, while other non-traditional ingredients have also begun being included in recent years.\nPickled herring remains a popular food or ingredient to dishes in many parts of Europe including Scandinavia, Great Britain, the Baltic, Eastern and Central Europe, as well as the Netherlands. It is also popular in parts of Canada such as British Columbia and Newfoundland. It is also associated with Ashkenazi Jewish cuisine, becoming a staple at kiddushes and social gatherings. Pickled herring is one of the twelve dishes traditionally served at Christmas Eve in Russia, Poland, Lithuania, and Ukraine. Pickled herring is also eaten at the stroke of midnight on New Year's Eve to symbolize a prosperous New Year in Poland, the Czech Republic, Germany, and parts of Scandinavia.","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Aringa-marinato.jpg/1200px-Aringa-marinato.jpg","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pickled_herring","original_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pickled_herring"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R2l="}]},{"client_msg_id":"DF5FCCA5-DAA6-49C0-8143-E7B964FB15C5","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"シュトーレンは12月頭くらいに作って少しずつ食べていくものだから、保存がきくように砂糖まみれになっているとか聞いたことがあるような","ts":"1637802056.349700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XcOL8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c60335d-47db-427d-9e0f-189ed787ef04","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"(民明書房っぽいw","ts":"1637802018.349100","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1637802033.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nf6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7D67A3A2-8AF6-4A35-A319-81237E5A715D","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"手刀練","ts":"1637801901.347200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tqq2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc9aadf4-5f41-469c-bd00-38c50b6c8a96","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u0026gt; 温かいお風呂に浸かりシュトーレンも幸せそうです:sparkles:\nこれすき","ts":"1637801001.346900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"an7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49ff8982-8123-4385-a4fe-9323f22ad7d3","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"シュトーレンたべたい","ts":"1637800968.346600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HIy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"843ae2cd-1b6c-4b06-bbc9-2f4490c89bba","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"やっぱヤバい(語彙力)\n\nドイツの菓子パン“シュトーレン”はカロリー爆弾→作り方を見るとその原因が一目瞭然だし「納得」できる理にかなった調理法だった \u003chttps://togetter.com/li/1807132|https://togetter.com/li/1807132\u003e","ts":"1637797999.346300","attachments":[{"fallback":"Togetter: ドイツの菓子パン“シュトーレン”はカロリー爆弾→作り方を見るとその原因が一目瞭然だし「納得」できる理にかなった調理法だった","id":1,"title":"ドイツの菓子パン“シュトーレン”はカロリー爆弾→作り方を見るとその原因が一目瞭然だし「納得」できる理にかなった調理法だった","title_link":"https://togetter.com/li/1807132","text":"更新日:11月24日19時09分","image_url":"https://s.togetter.com/ogp/787e2735ca5b18bb283c43f3fa5eea13-1200x630.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Togetter","service_icon":"https://s.togetter.com/static/1.16.02/web/img/tg/icon/apple-icon-57x57.png","from_url":"https://togetter.com/li/1807132","original_url":"https://togetter.com/li/1807132"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IPau"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a895b607-8197-45de-83f7-170b2c3a0e00","typ